  LeanVM.Guest.Memory.GuestCntWX

  The guest's static certificates counting `xor` instructions (`B2C.ωArm B2C.xmssArmC .xor`),
  checked (`kux_checked`), and the weight bounds they give (`kux_weightLe`, `kux_weight_le_of_stat`,
  `kux_weight_le_of_loop`). Generated by `scripts/count/gen.py`; do not edit.
-/

